  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GVE Off-Grid Electrification Follow-On Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project comprises of the implementation of a 1MW PV solar hybrid power solution with 1.2MWhrs of lithium-ion storage and 1MW of diesel backup genset. It also includes the enhancement of the existing distribution network and installation of smart prepaid meters to all the clients. Upon completion, GVE will oversee the billing, collection, and energy management of the clients in the cluster</narrative>
  </description>
